sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant F as JwtAuthFilter
    participant Auth as AuthController/Service
    participant Acc as AccountController/Service
    participant Exp as ExpenseController/Service
    participant Txn as TransactionController/Service
    participant Repo as JPA Repositories
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over C,DB: 1. Register
    C->>Auth: POST /api/auth/register {name,email,password,role}
    Auth->>Repo: findByEmail(email)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE email=?
    DB-->>Repo: none found
    Auth->>Auth: BCrypt.encode(password)
    Auth->>Repo: save(User)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO app_users
    Auth->>Auth: jwtService.generateToken(user)
    Auth-->>C: 200 { token }

    Note over C,DB: 2. Login
    C->>Auth: POST /api/auth/login {email,password}
    Auth->>Auth: authenticationManager.authenticate(...)
    Auth->>Repo: findByEmail(email)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE email=?
    Auth->>Auth: jwtService.generateToken(user)
    Auth-->>C: 200 { token }

    Note over C,DB: 3. Authenticated request (applies to every call below)
    C->>F: Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    F->>F: extractUsername(jwt)
    F->>Repo: loadUserByUsername(email)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE email=?
    F->>F: isTokenValid? -> SecurityContextHolder.setAuthentication
    F-->>C: request proceeds to controller

    Note over C,DB: 4. Create account
    C->>Acc: POST /accounts/create {accountType, initialBalance}
    Acc->>Repo: save(Account{user=currentUser})
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO accounts
    Acc-->>C: 200 "<type> account created with ID: <id>"

    Note over C,DB: 5. Create expense (spends from an account)
    C->>Exp: POST /api/expenses {accountId, categoryId, amount, note, timestamp}
    Exp->>Repo: findById(accountId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=?
    Exp->>Repo: findById(categoryId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM categories WHERE id=?
    Exp->>Exp: check balance >= amount
    Exp->>Repo: save(account) with balance - amount
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE accounts SET balance=?
    Exp->>Repo: save(Expense)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO expense
    Exp-->>C: 201 Expense

    Note over C,DB: 6. Transfer money between accounts
    C->>Txn: POST /api/transactions/transfer {senderAccountId, receiverAccountId, amount, note}
    Txn->>Repo: findById(senderAccountId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=?
    Txn->>Txn: verify sender.user.id == currentUser.id
    Txn->>Repo: findById(receiverAccountId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=?
    Txn->>Txn: check sender.balance >= amount
    Txn->>Repo: save(sender) balance - amount
    Txn->>Repo: save(receiver) balance + amount
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE accounts SET balance=? (x2)
    Txn->>Repo: save(Transaction{status=SUCCESS})
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO transactions
    Txn-->>C: 200 Transaction
